Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 23:10:03 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1143/1259] HERESY 1166: no page inside the server, nothing
 gzipped
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 04.10.2026: «Мы договорились избавиться от index.html.gz и других .gz,
потому что это локальный сервис и нам нет смысла экономить на сжатии файлов».

- CMake embeds nothing: no xxd header, no tools/public/index.html.gz in git.
- yue-server reads build/tools/public/index.html from disk at every load:
  RUACH_PAGE (start.sh), else the page beside its own build. A page not
  built yet answers 503 with what to run, never an old copy; no 406 for a
  client without gzip. The log names the page at start.
- The spectrum from the lab is read as it comes (the lab sends it as it is);
  a spectrum overtaken by another take no longer leaves its "Forge is
  measuring…" over the newer one's result.

Checked on a throwaway CPU server: the page beside the build byte for byte,
not gzipped though gzip is accepted; 503 for a missing page; 200 for a
client that asks for no gzip.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
